{"seq":37,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"4eafc3b2-81f1-4601-aaa7-03ee4a9f676b","runId":"run_1_1788433917710","result":"Done! I've saved the regex to `/app/regex.txt`. Here's how it works:\n\n**Key components:**\n\n1. **IPv4 Address**: `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|[1-9]?[0-9])` matches octets 0-255 without leading zeros, repeated 4 times with dots\n\n2. **Date with Month Validation**:\n   - Months 01,03,05,07,08,10,12 → days 01-31\n   - Months 04,06,09,11 → days 01-30  \n   - Month 02 → days 01-29 (as specified)\n\n3. **Last Date Only**: The negative lookahead `(?!.*\\b\\d{4}-...)` ensures the captured date is not followed by another valid date on the same line\n\n4. **Word Boundaries**: `\\b` prevents matching dates/IPs embedded in longer strings (e.g., won't match \"user1134-12-1234\")\n\n5. **Line Processing**: The `^...$` anchors with MULTILINE flag ensure each line is independently checked for an IPv4 address, and only the last date is captured per line.","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":101325,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4eafc3b2-81f1-4601-aaa7-03ee4a9f676b","total_cost_usd":0.07868835,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12197,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":11911,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":11059},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12197},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":732,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11254,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11254,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001238,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonical